{
  "id": "444",
  "title": "Being the Third Wheel",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-01-27",
  "synopsis": "Ben doesn't want to be the third wheel.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/643/d5320b887b1ff6c700be6001eb6d33a17f57c35f.mp3?1589791687",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 3: Who is Little Yu?",
    "chapter": 29,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我不想当电灯泡\n\n丽丽：本，这周六你有空吗？我们去颐和园玩吧！\n本：好呀！我还没有去过颐和园呢。\n丽丽：那正好了。那周六上午10点见！我男朋友小何会来学校接我们。\n本：你男朋友也去吗？\n丽丽：对呀。我们一起去。\n本：那我还是算了吧。我不想当电灯泡。",
    "traditional": "我不想當電燈泡\n\n麗麗：本，這週六你有空嗎？我們去頤和園玩吧！\n本：好呀！我還沒有去過頤和園呢。\n麗麗：那正好了。那週六上午10點見！我男朋友小何會來學校接我們。\n本：你男朋友也去嗎？\n麗麗：對呀。我們一起去。\n本：那我還是算了吧。我不想當電燈泡。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I don't want to be the third wheel"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：本，这周六你有空吗？我们去颐和园玩吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：本，這週六你有空嗎？我們去頤和園玩吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì běn zhè zhōu liù nǐ yǒu kòng ma wǒ men qù yí hé yuán wán ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ben, are you free on Saturday? Let's go to the Summer Palace!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：好呀！我还没有去过颐和园呢。",
      "traditional": "本：好呀！我還沒有去過頤和園呢。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo ya wǒ hái méi yǒu qù guò yí hé yuán ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Sure! I still haven't been to the Summer Palace."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那正好了。那周六上午10点见！我男朋友小何会来学校接我们。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那正好了。那週六上午10點見！我男朋友小何會來學校接我們。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà zhèng hǎo le nà zhōu liù shàng wǔ 1 diǎn jiàn wǒ nán péng you xiǎo hé huì lái xué xiào jiē wǒ men",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Perfect. Then let's meet at 10 a.m. on Saturday! My boyfriend Little He will come pick us up at the school."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：你男朋友也去吗？",
      "traditional": "本：你男朋友也去嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ nán péng you yě qù ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Your boyfriend is going too?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：对呀。我们一起去。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：對呀。我們一起去。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì duì ya wǒ men yì qǐ qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Yes, we're going together."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：那我还是算了吧。我不想当电灯泡。",
      "traditional": "本：那我還是算了吧。我不想當電燈泡。",
      "pinyin": "běn nà wǒ hái shi suàn le ba wǒ bù xiǎng dāng diàn dēng pào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Then I think I'll pass. I don't want to be the third wheel."
    }
  ],
